@SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000

### POST - Add Campus Service
POST {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/CampusServiceApi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceName": "Computer Lab",
  "description": "Computer and internet facilities for students",
  "location": "Block B"
}

### PUT - Update Campus Service
PUT {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/CampusServiceApi/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": 2,
  "serviceName": "Updated Computer Lab",
  "description": "Updated computer and internet facilities",
  "location": "Block C"
}
### DELETE - Delete Campus Service
DELETE {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/CampusServiceApi/2